{radvecn, norvecc, cirvec}, being the radial, normal and circular axes of \
each voxel respectivley.\nIf the option showPlot is true the output is \
{{radvecn, norvecc, cirvec}, plots}", "Documentation" -> 
    Association["Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/CardiacCoordinateSystem"], 
    "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, 
