  InformationData[
   Association[
   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "AnisoFilterTensor[tens, diffdata] Filter the tensor tens using an \
anisotropic diffusion filter (Perona-Malik). \nIt uses the diffusion weighted \
data diffdata to find edges that are not visible in the tensor.\nEdge weights \
based on the diffusion data are averaged over all normalized diffusion \
direction.\n\nOutput is the smoothed tensor.\n\nAnisoFilterTensor[] is based \
on DOI: 10.1109/ISBI.2006.1624856", "Documentation" -> 
    Association["Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/AnisoFilterTensor"], 
    "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, 
