series.\\nRegisterData[{data, vox}] registers the data series using the given \
voxel size.\\nRegisterData[{data, mask}] registers the data series only using \
data whithin the mask.\\nRegisterData[{data, mask, vox}] registers the data \
series using the given voxel size only using data within the \
mask.\\n\\nRegisterData[target, moving] registers the moving data to the \
target data. target can be 2D or 3D. moving can be the same of one dimension \
higher than the target.\\nRegisterData[{target, mask, vox},{moving, mask, \
vox}] registers the data using the given voxel size only using data within \
the mask.\\nRegisterData[{target, vox}, moving] registers the data using the \
